WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.730
<b>2 Years Earlier</b>

00:01.660 --> 00:02.800
<i>An animal.</i>

00:03.510 --> 00:05.990
<i>And arrogant for a barbarian.</i>

00:06.630 --> 00:09.840
<i>Uneducated, without a shred 
of substance to him.</i>

00:10.570 --> 00:13.490
<i>Just the sight of him 
makes me want to vomit.</i>

00:13.740 --> 00:17.950
That's enough out of you, geezer. 
The dwarves are useful.

00:17.950 --> 00:21.380
What reason is there not to add them
 as part of the tower?

00:21.380 --> 00:24.250
They are a people who cannot use magic.

00:24.500 --> 00:26.880
But they aren't incompetent.

00:26.880 --> 00:28.750
If you trust them enough to dig holes,

00:28.750 --> 00:32.260
they'd be far more useful 
running wild in the dungeon.

00:32.260 --> 00:37.770
If your ludicrous pride keeps you 
from making use of them, then I'll do it.

00:38.060 --> 00:42.690
Watching the world fall because we didn't
tap our resources wouldn't be any fun.

00:43.200 --> 00:44.520
Or...

00:44.900 --> 00:47.370
are you telling me there's 
some other reason for this?

00:49.900 --> 00:51.580
I will not tell you.

00:54.030 --> 00:55.720
Is that so?

00:57.150 --> 00:59.250
What are you trying to do, barbarian?

00:59.500 --> 01:03.380
Lowering your weapon so quickly... 
Was that all merely a hollow bluff?

01:03.900 --> 01:07.380
He didn't say, "There is no reason." 
Or even, "I can't tell you."

01:07.770 --> 01:09.590
He said, "I will not tell you."

01:10.280 --> 01:13.660
That means now isn't the time 
to lay it all out in the open, right?

01:15.060 --> 01:18.160
<i>But occasionally, 
his instincts are oddly accurate.</i>

01:18.630 --> 01:23.480
If this is to help annihilate the 
Celestial Host, I'll pipe down.

01:24.010 --> 01:27.650
But if we can't take 'em down... 
That's where I draw the line.

01:29.710 --> 01:36.160
<i>Making that animal sit and stay is 
a heavy task even for the Supreme Throne.</i>

01:39.000 --> 01:44.100
<i>His manner is rather too 
provocative for the magical world.</i>

01:44.920 --> 01:47.370
You've gone too far, Zeo.

01:47.370 --> 01:50.330
Your defiance of Lord Aaron 
makes me doubt your sanity.

01:51.390 --> 01:53.430
Right back at you.

01:53.430 --> 01:57.760
You know that if we keep going like this, 
we'll lose. So why won't you change?

01:57.760 --> 02:01.430
If they hold you back, common practices 
and systems are just dead weight.

02:01.880 --> 02:05.500
Especially this "worth" system mages have.

02:07.350 --> 02:10.470
You must be more self-aware 
as a Magia Vander.

02:10.470 --> 02:12.440
I explained this to you just recently, no?

02:12.440 --> 02:13.450
I want it.

02:13.740 --> 02:14.950
Or I don't.

02:15.380 --> 02:17.830
That's all life is about.

02:18.630 --> 02:24.330
<i>His way of living exhausts me,
but also makes me the tiniest bit envious.</i>

02:25.770 --> 02:28.840
It's so nice that idiots don't need 
to think at all, isn't it, Zeo?

02:28.840 --> 02:31.950
You lot just think too much. That's all.

02:31.950 --> 02:34.810
I'll move as my desires dictate.

02:35.220 --> 02:39.340
<i>Indeed. An idiot with no power 
is simply a foolish commoner.</i>

02:39.340 --> 02:42.440
<i>However, an idiot with power...</i>

02:43.230 --> 02:44.640
<i>is exceedingly dangerous.</i>

02:47.130 --> 02:49.740
<i>It's fine enough when he's an ally.</i>

02:49.740 --> 02:52.790
<i>But when he becomes an enemy...</i>

02:52.790 --> 02:56.230
<i>the Lightning Lord's Wand, Thorzeus Fasce,</i>

02:56.230 --> 02:58.690
<i>turns into the worst kind of obstacle.</i>

03:00.960 --> 03:02.950
I'm taking this guy.

03:04.300 --> 03:05.210
<i>That's right.</i>

03:06.550 --> 03:08.650
<i>Just like he's doing right now!</i>

03:24.980 --> 03:29.690
Episode 23 
A Roar of Ice and Lightning

04:41.060 --> 04:42.810
What a coincidence.

04:42.810 --> 04:47.020
Will is the one thing 
I don't intend to cede to anyone.

04:47.340 --> 04:49.940
And if anyone gets in my way, 
I'll pulverize them!

04:51.230 --> 04:53.060
Sounds good, you brazen wench!

04:53.060 --> 04:54.260
Let's do this.

04:54.260 --> 04:57.190
He belongs to the winner. 
No complaints, right?

04:57.190 --> 04:58.820
Fine with me!

04:58.820 --> 05:01.390
I'm telling you, this is just insane!

05:01.390 --> 05:03.820
A duel between Magia Vander?!

05:03.820 --> 05:06.330
Can you two try to stop them, please?

05:06.330 --> 05:08.480
I assure you that would be pointless.

05:08.480 --> 05:12.960
Even if we were to intervene, 
it would only delay the issue.

05:13.260 --> 05:16.490
If that shiftless woman and 
the barbarian were to kill each other,

05:16.490 --> 05:18.310
it would also reduce my heartburn.

05:18.310 --> 05:19.590
Don't say that!

05:21.590 --> 05:24.370
Sarissa, please look after Will.

05:25.100 --> 05:27.040
Wh-What? Wait.

05:31.640 --> 05:34.180
H-Hang on, are they serious?

05:34.180 --> 05:37.730
They're the apex of the magical world, 
and something this ridiculous has them...

05:37.730 --> 05:41.320
What can you do?
That's the Magia Vander for you!

05:43.740 --> 05:44.870
What's the signal?

05:44.870 --> 05:46.740
No need. Just bring it.

05:46.740 --> 05:48.740
Hey! This is no time to be sleeping!

05:49.030 --> 05:50.190
Wake up!

05:51.660 --> 05:53.610
El Glace Frosse...

05:55.240 --> 05:56.500
El Seven.

06:02.440 --> 06:04.640
Fruzel Cardeneia!

06:13.640 --> 06:14.520
She began with...

06:14.520 --> 06:15.560
All of that?!

06:19.170 --> 06:20.940
What are you aiming at?

06:21.380 --> 06:22.440
Crash.

06:26.700 --> 06:28.290
Lady Elfaria!

06:38.210 --> 06:39.460
Ars Weiss?

06:39.740 --> 06:41.000
When did she cast that?

06:41.460 --> 06:46.030
In the beginning, with Cardeneia. 
The moment his vision was obstructed.

06:46.030 --> 06:50.600
Lady Efaria's activation speed 
is the fastest in the tower.

06:50.860 --> 06:53.850
And as for ruthlessness with her foes,

06:54.250 --> 06:56.040
she is also the preeminent Magia Vander.

06:57.350 --> 06:59.800
I will never let you have Will.

07:00.230 --> 07:02.900
Armenta Auliscas.

07:06.030 --> 07:07.610
Rapid fire with no incantation?!

07:07.610 --> 07:11.120
And with a high-level spell whose 
incantation would be more than ten verses!

07:11.710 --> 07:16.080
<i>Back on floor 11, I struggled so hard 
to cast that, and she just instantly...</i>

07:16.820 --> 07:18.630
This defies logic!

07:21.630 --> 07:23.630
Riville Calantibium.

07:23.630 --> 07:25.260
Stellas Natea.

07:28.880 --> 07:32.200
A hail of attacks alongside 
her doubles in a heavy barrage.

07:32.730 --> 07:35.890
She seems to be doing as she pleases 
even more than usual today.

07:35.890 --> 07:39.560
Her might has always lain in 
projectile speed and accuracy.

07:39.970 --> 07:44.040
As one would expect, Elfaria has the 
advantage in a long-range casting fight.

07:44.680 --> 07:47.150
But she's up against another monster.

07:49.630 --> 07:51.280
So high and mighty!

07:57.710 --> 07:59.670
Valgan Flude.

08:04.300 --> 08:09.050
Is this all you've got, harridan?!

08:10.190 --> 08:11.930
You're the last one!

08:13.010 --> 08:15.110
Zalgia Saga!

08:16.020 --> 08:18.150
<i>This one's a double, too?</i>

08:18.150 --> 08:19.790
<i>The real one...</i>

08:19.790 --> 08:21.520
<i>is even higher!</i>

08:21.520 --> 08:25.350
All the attacking and defending up to this
point was to allow her to escape upward,

08:25.350 --> 08:28.780
which will allow her 
to hammer down her true attack.

08:29.130 --> 08:33.780
And she did it while maintaining a double
so accurate, it passed as a Magia Vander.

08:33.780 --> 08:37.540
Using Hide to circumvent Search 
was just a little bonus.

08:39.850 --> 08:43.850
Did you have fun playing dollies with me?

08:44.660 --> 08:47.460
Circle: On. Full connect.

08:48.030 --> 08:50.220
Grand Glast: Dodecra!

08:51.620 --> 08:53.470
That's pretty good!

08:57.220 --> 08:58.730
P-Put up barrier walls!

09:03.960 --> 09:06.020
Ch-Chained circles?

09:06.020 --> 09:10.490
Making use of her destroyed doubles 
to multiply the force of her attack...

09:10.810 --> 09:14.620
Even a Magia Vander would've 
been blown away by that, right?

09:15.120 --> 09:16.620
No.

09:17.700 --> 09:21.340
Playing with dolls 
isn't satisfying at all.

09:27.750 --> 09:29.510
Look sharp!

09:30.380 --> 09:31.410
Hey.

09:33.030 --> 09:34.890
First, you fall.

09:54.280 --> 09:55.870
Lady Elfaria!

10:01.070 --> 10:03.250
I'll be taking that guy off your hands!

10:11.910 --> 10:15.140
He's a mage, but he's forced her
 into an up-close fight.

10:15.420 --> 10:19.010
What is that about? Lihanna, does he have 
close-quarters combat magic like you?

10:19.280 --> 10:20.420
No.

10:20.420 --> 10:23.820
He's simply letting 
his magical energy spill forth.

10:23.820 --> 10:25.540
Exactly.

10:25.540 --> 10:27.740
Watch closely, Owenzaus.

10:27.740 --> 10:32.280
That is the ideal we in the Lightning 
Faction should strive to emulate.

10:32.560 --> 10:34.820
Even without relying 
upon casting techniques,

10:34.820 --> 10:38.280
by just pouring out his magical energy, 
he leaves everything else in the dust.

10:38.280 --> 10:40.860
For Lord Zeo, 
it's merely a form of travel.

10:41.540 --> 10:45.540
The awe and dread it inspires have 
earned it the name "Lightningstrike."

10:46.010 --> 10:50.740
Zeo's Lightningstrike surpasses 
even the speed of Elfaria's magic.

10:51.360 --> 10:56.380
Such absolute, monstrous aptitude
cannot be gauged with reason alone.

10:57.150 --> 11:01.810
I loathe him, the symbol of all
that cannot be measured!

11:02.090 --> 11:04.560
So this is the Magia Vander...

11:05.550 --> 11:10.500
Thorzeus Fasce, Zeo Thorzeus Reinbolt!

11:11.270 --> 11:12.570
<b>Lightning Lord's Wand</b>

11:12.690 --> 11:16.070
<b><u>Zeo Thorzeus Reinbolt</u>

Race: Rhizanth   Age: 23    Height: 177 cm
Birthday: 7th of Hallasmoon
Likes: Meat, alcohol, spicy flavors, people who claw
 their way up from rock bottom
Dislikes: Vegetables, juiced greens, 
sweet flavors, people content with being weak</b>

11:12.690 --> 11:16.070
<b>Someone He'll Never Forget: The previous 
Lightning Lord's Wand, Thorzeus Fasce
Deepest Dungeon Floor Reached: 48th
Equipment: Lightning Lord's Wand, Thorzeus Fasce; 
Lightningstrike Necklace from the previous Thorzeus Fasce
Skills: Nearly all lightning magic; concurrently incanting Lightningstrike; bare-handed fighting tactics learned from the dwarves

As a Magia Vander, he is the most powerful lightning mage. He is combat instinct incarnate, and even among the Magia Vander,
 his unparalleled strength in close-quarters combat is boast-worthy. He possesses a natural gift for recognizing the types of magic
 and techniques that suit him, and for stealing them from others. The way he lives his life has earned him the nickname "barbarian."</b>

11:17.660 --> 11:21.080
<b><u>Sarissa Alfeld</u>

Race: Rhizanth   Age: 27   Height: 172 cm
Birthday: 14th of Ellsmoon
Likes: Happy, sickeningly sweet romance novels
Dislikes: Walnut cookies
First Love: Her older former fiancé

Deepest Dungeon Floor Reached: 37th
Equipment: Coldiron wand
Skills: Nearly all ice magic; how to force Elfaria awake</b>

11:17.660 --> 11:21.080
<b>The aide-de-camp of the ice faction. As Elfaria possesses zero ability to lead an organization, Sarissa toils away,
 essentially managing the faction on her own. She was once the leading candidate to become Albis Vina, but when
 a certain prodigy appeared, that was scrapped. At the time, she saw Elfaria as an enemy, but now she's completely at her mercy.</b>

11:22.390 --> 11:24.330
Valgnar Donner!

11:33.630 --> 11:34.340
Frall!

11:36.470 --> 11:38.470
Get outta my way!

11:45.680 --> 11:48.270
Who do you think will win, Finn?

11:48.570 --> 11:49.650
Zeo.

11:51.430 --> 11:55.900
If Elfaria, who created twelve new spells,
is a genius in spellwork,

11:56.240 --> 11:58.660
then Zeo is a mighty figure in praxis.

12:00.530 --> 12:02.530
So you're a double, too?

12:02.530 --> 12:04.420
Xelunea Caulis!

12:11.960 --> 12:14.580
Crafty sleight of hand 
is the one thing you're good at.

12:15.250 --> 12:17.570
When did you switch places?

12:22.800 --> 12:25.890
Are you about to run out of doubles?!

12:40.070 --> 12:42.240
You're just gonna run around?!

12:47.410 --> 12:52.160
The deepest dungeon floor he's reached 
is floor 48, second only to Aaron.

12:52.160 --> 12:56.570
His abilities are far too specialized 
toward actual combat.

13:10.390 --> 13:15.100
He's a wand, but his natural state 
is very close to that of a sword.

13:15.820 --> 13:22.010
If I'm honest, I think that joining Zeo 
would serve Will better. Just my opinion.

13:22.660 --> 13:24.430
A long-range fight is one thing,

13:24.430 --> 13:27.410
but in close combat,
Zeo's strategies rise to the top.

13:27.410 --> 13:29.910
Has this already been decided?

13:33.720 --> 13:34.990
Lefiya.

13:34.990 --> 13:38.380
Why is Lady Ellenor sulking like that?

13:38.850 --> 13:40.950
Well, you see, Miss Filvis...

13:40.950 --> 13:43.920
While it may only have been in ice magic,

13:43.920 --> 13:46.390
Lady Ellenor was soundly 
defeated by Albis Vina,

13:46.390 --> 13:49.260
so she doesn't want her to win.
But she also doesn't want her to lose.

13:49.260 --> 13:51.140
It's a complicated state of mind.

13:51.610 --> 13:52.650
I see.

13:52.650 --> 13:54.400
Silence, wretches!

13:59.780 --> 14:01.240
Lady Elfaria...

14:02.490 --> 14:04.650
Hey! I'm serious! Wake up!

14:04.650 --> 14:07.740
If this keeps up, 
Lady Elfaria's going to lose!

14:08.190 --> 14:10.410
If there's anything 
that might give her strength,

14:10.410 --> 14:12.250
your voice is all we've got!

14:14.550 --> 14:16.880
Elfie...

14:22.590 --> 14:24.340
Are you finished?

14:24.340 --> 14:28.510
Then I'll be taking that sword of yours.

14:38.200 --> 14:39.030
Huh?

14:41.050 --> 14:43.130
Looks like it isn't over yet, Finn.

14:43.780 --> 14:47.410
It appears that girl is exactly like Will.

14:47.750 --> 14:49.160
I won't give him up.

14:49.530 --> 14:53.040
I'd never give my Will 
to the likes of you!

14:53.300 --> 14:55.250
So you <i>can</i> roar!

14:55.250 --> 14:58.790
This is the first time I've seen you 
boiling over like this!

14:58.790 --> 15:02.300
What is it that's driving you 
to go this far?

15:05.810 --> 15:06.660
Love!

15:07.710 --> 15:08.730
Huh?

15:11.170 --> 15:13.810
Will protected me.

15:14.640 --> 15:17.180
Will pursued me.

15:18.430 --> 15:23.200
Will has always held fast to
the promise we made together!

15:23.690 --> 15:25.450
Which is why this time...

15:25.450 --> 15:26.920
It's my turn!

15:27.790 --> 15:31.080
My love for Will 
will never lose to anything!

15:32.220 --> 15:34.330
So that's your desire, is it?

15:37.080 --> 15:38.960
In that case, show me.

15:40.320 --> 15:42.920
Show me that ridiculous power!

15:44.920 --> 15:47.220
Zeo's Lightningstrike 
is supernaturally swift.

15:47.220 --> 15:49.950
He passes electric current 
through his whole body,

15:49.950 --> 15:54.370
enhancing his movement and reaction speed. So when he attacks,

15:54.370 --> 15:56.480
mages are unable to cope.

15:57.200 --> 15:57.980
However...

15:57.980 --> 16:00.110
El Glace Frosse...

16:00.370 --> 16:01.590
El Ten.

16:02.420 --> 16:05.260
If the entirety of his accelerated 
Lightningstrike gets frozen,

16:05.260 --> 16:06.960
none of that matters.

16:08.510 --> 16:10.700
Myrdas Fridoliete!

16:11.620 --> 16:13.320
You...

16:13.320 --> 16:14.490
What is this?

16:14.830 --> 16:19.250
The conditions to activate it are most 
taxing. This is my secret weapon.

16:19.800 --> 16:21.440
Within its area of effect,

16:21.440 --> 16:25.020
once I expend half of my magical energy, 
I can finally create...

16:25.020 --> 16:26.970
this barrier of frost and snow.

16:27.450 --> 16:30.760
The fact that I have to fire off 
so many spells is a drawback.

16:31.460 --> 16:35.220
Her barrage of advanced magic 
was all to prepare that barrier?

16:35.550 --> 16:39.980
She knew full well that she was on the 
back foot and readied her greatest trap?

16:40.260 --> 16:44.860
This secret play of hers completely 
shut down my magic as well.

16:45.150 --> 16:48.030
The closer one approaches, 
the harder the freezing takes hold.

16:48.030 --> 16:49.810
It prevents all movement.

16:50.250 --> 16:52.620
The barbarian's speed 
was turned against him.

16:53.760 --> 16:55.370
The truth is...

16:55.620 --> 17:00.850
this magic was meant to trap 
shy little Will so that I could hug him.

17:01.370 --> 17:06.630
But now that I've used it, 
I won't hesitate to pulverize you.

17:06.970 --> 17:09.760
You scheming minx!

17:09.760 --> 17:11.180
Will is...

17:11.720 --> 17:13.840
mine and mine alone!

17:15.250 --> 17:17.580
My bride!

17:24.520 --> 17:25.610
Lord Zeo!

17:25.610 --> 17:27.880
Lady Elfaria fired back at him!

17:27.880 --> 17:29.150
Hey! Look!

17:29.150 --> 17:31.200
Lady Elfaria did it!

17:31.870 --> 17:33.240
Elfie?

17:39.090 --> 17:41.680
Usurpers have come.

17:42.400 --> 17:44.600
O innocent light...

17:45.250 --> 17:47.620
O guiltless eyes...

17:48.990 --> 17:52.660
O promised pinnacle of glory!

17:54.410 --> 17:59.280
Thy great achievements are, by these 
venomous snakes, now to be overturned!

17:59.890 --> 18:03.270
<i>Zeo is using an incantation? 
He must be serious.</i>

18:03.620 --> 18:07.570
<i>That idiotic woman's barrier freezes 
even magic. To break through,</i>

18:07.570 --> 18:11.140
<i>the only option is to hammer it 
with even greater firepower, but still...</i>

18:11.140 --> 18:13.780
That blasted barbarian has 
no concept of measured retaliation!

18:14.140 --> 18:16.020
Lefiya! Filvis!

18:16.020 --> 18:17.440
Understood.

18:19.900 --> 18:20.870
That's...

18:21.290 --> 18:24.290
I've... never seen anything like it.

18:24.580 --> 18:27.290
That incantation... It can't be!

18:27.580 --> 18:30.420
Magic even greater than advanced magic...

18:32.950 --> 18:35.000
Prime magic!

18:35.750 --> 18:37.680
White ice waxes full.

18:37.680 --> 18:39.330
A maelstrom of violent calamity.

18:39.990 --> 18:41.580
A shield rent to pieces.

18:42.100 --> 18:43.900
Scars from the claws of strife.

18:44.470 --> 18:46.120
Paradise is dead and gone,

18:46.650 --> 18:48.440
concealed by silver snow.

18:48.900 --> 18:50.120
As the wind roared,

18:50.690 --> 18:53.490
the witch mourned a thousand heroes!

18:54.570 --> 18:56.540
The offense of falsehood.

18:56.540 --> 18:58.320
A price paid without cause.

18:58.320 --> 19:01.880
Send the brand of transgression 
into a sea of blood!

19:03.780 --> 19:05.580
Strike now, thunderous renown!

19:06.090 --> 19:09.540
The roaring tribute has suddenly 
flipped, slaughtering thine love!

19:10.370 --> 19:12.670
Shatter, O reason!

19:12.670 --> 19:17.300
Should this lamenting wish for the mask
 of the vanquished beast Minos...

19:22.750 --> 19:27.090
Attacking, moving from place to place, 
and incanting at the same time...

19:27.090 --> 19:28.690
That is concurrent incantation.

19:29.130 --> 19:31.630
To think he'd even steal 
secret arts from the elves...

19:31.630 --> 19:33.690
He really is such a barbarian.

19:40.250 --> 19:41.580
The people have vanished.

19:41.580 --> 19:42.980
The invading enemy has ceased to be.

19:42.980 --> 19:45.210
And nothing else remains.

19:45.210 --> 19:47.880
In a fortress of ice, 
the witch stands alone!

19:48.210 --> 19:49.880
Her tears fall on the graves.

19:49.880 --> 19:51.370
Her prayers turn to ash.

19:51.370 --> 19:52.890
And her oath flies beyond!

19:53.500 --> 19:56.890
Her lonely throne 
now names itself guardian!

19:57.870 --> 19:59.840
A relay incantation.

19:59.840 --> 20:03.080
Her doubles are picking up 
the incantation to keep the spell going!

20:03.510 --> 20:08.230
The technique I learned against the 
Grand Duke, performed by the originator...

20:08.770 --> 20:11.230
Huh? What is all of this?

20:11.860 --> 20:14.610
Elfie, why are you fighting?

20:16.790 --> 20:19.700
Then these false crimes 
shall lead to the axe of truth!

20:20.110 --> 20:21.320
Take power by force!

20:21.710 --> 20:22.950
Trample everything!

20:23.330 --> 20:24.700
Massacre everyone!

20:25.050 --> 20:29.290
Make an offering of the venomous 
snakes and begin a feast of despair!

20:30.960 --> 20:32.210
Wings of frozen earth!

20:32.730 --> 20:34.210
Beak of a guardian!

20:34.620 --> 20:35.960
Snow white truth!

20:36.390 --> 20:39.200
Indeed, this sovereign of the
 frozen skies shall sever the chains!

20:40.630 --> 20:42.560
The demons' sovereign laughs!

20:42.560 --> 20:43.970
The sages celebrate!

20:44.350 --> 20:48.350
For the fleeting blossoms that falsify 
the boundaries, an eternal song of praise!

20:52.070 --> 20:53.980
Perish, Kingdom of Thunder!

20:53.980 --> 20:56.400
Meet thy foolish end here!

20:56.740 --> 20:58.390
Come now, world of silver snow!

20:58.390 --> 21:00.860
Let there be a sky free of strife here!

21:00.860 --> 21:01.780
Elfie! Wait—

21:28.230 --> 21:31.390
Virgas Argo Thorzeus!

21:31.850 --> 21:34.600
Glacia Last Albis!

21:43.030 --> 21:44.530
Dio Grail!

23:28.090 --> 23:31.060
<b>Wistoria: Wand and Sword</b>

23:36.730 --> 23:39.190
Next time on <i>Wistoria: Wand and Sword</i>,

23:39.620 --> 23:42.960
episode 24, 
"A Story of a Dream with No End."

23:40.520 --> 23:46.030
Episode 24
A Story of a Dream with No End
